[{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\ngetwininfo([{winid}])                                   *getwininfo()*\n                ウィンドウに関する情報を、辞書のリスト |List| として返す。\n \n                {winid}が与えられた場合、そのIDを持つウィンドウに関する情報が\n                リスト |List| として1項目にして返される。ウィンドウが存在しな\n                い場合、結果は空のリストになる。\n \n                {winid}がなければすべてのタブページのすべてのウィンドウに関す\n                る情報が返される。\n \n                リストの各項目は次のエントリを持つ辞書 |Dictionary| である:\n                        botline         最下の完全に表示されたバッファ行\n                        bufnr           ウィンドウ内のバッファ番号\n                        height          ウィンドウの高さ (winbarを除く)\n                        loclist         locationリストを表示してる場合は1\n                                        {Vimが|+quickfix|機能付きでコンパイル\n                                        されたときのみ有効}\n                        quickfix        quickfixまたはlocationリストウィンドウ\n                                        の場合は1\n                                        {Vimが|+quickfix|機能付きでコンパイル\n                                        されたときのみ有効}\n                        terminal        端末ウィンドウの場合は 1\n                                        {Vimが|+terminal|機能付きでコンパイル\n                                        されたときのみ有効}\n                        tabnr           タブページ番号\n                        topline         最上に表示されたバッファ行\n                        variables       ウィンドウローカル変数の辞書への参照\n                        width           ウィンドウ幅\n                        winbar          ウィンドウがツールバーを持っていれば\n                                        1、そうでなければ 0\n                        wincol          ウィンドウの最も左のスクリーン列、\n                                        |win_screenpos()| の \"col\"\n                        winid           |window-ID|\n                        winnr           ウィンドウ番号\n                        winrow          ウィンドウの最も上のスクリーン行、\n                                        |win_screenpos()| の \"row\"\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        GetWinnr()-\u0026gt;getwininfo()\n```","ts":"1635342234.207600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"384ee854-1d23-445a-aea5-a56a1a7411cc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":h getwininfo() fixed","ts":"1635342234.207500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XzWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14bf1b4a-4263-40de-9fae-3a1a99c96254","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"更新しておいたけど、helpとしては変らない部分","ts":"1635341257.206900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hzvs"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Utilities for :help\n\nCommands:\n  /vimhelp plugin  Manage Vim plugins\n\nUnknown argument: update","ts":"1635341180.206300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3757f4c3-c1da-4227-bf9a-0251718fc0cc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":vimhelp update","ts":"1635341179.206200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vmG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"831808A4-2996-4912-8B43-E6E2D7F38916","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"あ、よく見たらみやくじゃなかった…w","ts":"1635341167.206000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"upM"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nwin_gettype([{nr}])                                     *win_gettype()*\n                Return the type of the window:\n                        \"autocmd\"       autocommand window. Temporary window\n                                        used to execute autocommands.\n                        \"command\"       command-line window |cmdwin|\n                        (empty)         normal window\n                        \"loclist\"       |location-list-window|\n                        \"popup\"         popup window |popup|\n                        \"preview\"       preview window |preview-window|\n                        \"quickfix\"      |quickfix-window|\n                        \"unknown\"       window {nr} not found\n \n                When {nr} is omitted return the type of the current window.\n                When {nr} is given return the type of this window by number or\n                |window-ID|.\n \n                Also see the 'buftype' option.  When running a terminal in a\n                popup window then 'buftype' is \"terminal\" and win_gettype()\n                returns \"popup\".\n```","ts":"1635341130.205200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"402FAEEF-047F-4AD2-AD99-D04216AF63D3","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":h win_gettype()@en","ts":"1635341130.205100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bfF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebb027ad-b8c9-4e65-9716-48675604cb68","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"PRed\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/vimdoc-ja-working/pull/962/files\u003e","ts":"1635341126.205000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s+E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5C55F34A-8D8A-465B-A513-58A46C5E29AE","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"みやく","ts":"1635341111.204300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SI+R"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nwin_gettype([{nr}])                                     *win_gettype()*\n                ウィンドウの種別を返す:\n                        \"autocmd\"       自動コマンドのウィンドウ。自動コマンド\n                                        を実行するに使う一時的なウィンドウ。\n                        \"command\"       コマンドラインウィンドウ |cmdwin|\n                        (empty)         通常のウィンドウ\n                        \"loclist\"       |location-list-window|\n                        \"popup\"         ポップアップウィンドウ |popup|\n                        \"preview\"       プレビューウィンドウ |preview-window|\n                        \"quickfix\"      |quickfix-window|\n                        \"unknown\"       ウィンドウ{nr}が見付からない\n \n                {nr} を省略した場合は現在のウィンドウの種別を返す。\n                {nr} が与えられた場合はそのウィンドウ番号または |window-ID| の\n                種別を返す。\n \n                'buftype' オプションも参照すること。ポップアップウィンドウ上で\n                ターミナルが起動している場合、'buftype' は \"terminal\" であり、\n                win_gettype() は \"popup\" を返す。\n```","ts":"1635341096.204100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"04E11332-7D71-4EB5-AF98-3B0EDDBC86AB","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":h win_gettype()","ts":"1635341096.204000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKLf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2FE543AA-6F47-42EB-B15A-358CC40FEE26","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"最近だと win_gettype() でも取れますね \u0026gt; quickfix, loclist","ts":"1635341075.203400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oNW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a49f19d-05e6-4e09-b52d-f6c20fa21eb9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"脈々と受け継がれてきた未訳の文章","ts":"1635340658.201800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["U01D44KSY9Z","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o851"}]},{"client_msg_id":"992a192a-2b70-4913-abeb-03f16059bf08","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"恐らく最新であろう手元でも未訳ですね","ts":"1635340607.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h+7D"}]},{"c