"rich_text","block_id":"HDREq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6d86f38-ddbf-4165-84a9-cd0921248c2a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ご存知の方がいたら教えていただきたいんですが\n現在のウィンドウがlocation listなのか、quickfix listなのかを判定する方法って、実際リストが空かどうかを見る以外に方法はありますか？","ts":"1635339256.186300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TFYmG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5711b0a0-603f-4a09-b8f4-9eec1b7f75eb","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"今はフォーマッタにvim-rufoを使っているのでrubyでefm-langserverを止めても問題ないんですけどefmにrufoを移行しようと思ってたので止めなきゃいけないのはあまり嬉しくないですね…","ts":"1635330143.184100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dJ+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15c1d7c6-133a-4e17-a41f-8fb98d18d296","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"efmがなんでも反応するからなあ...","ts":"1635330075.183100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87846785-80b2-40bd-a373-c203c5097b52","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ruby の lint ツールとかと連携する時困るやつか…。","ts":"1635329993.181700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EAf6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23edc906-6216-4297-8289-a609b9392852","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"del_flg とかと一緒で true/false の意味がちょっと逆転するの辛いですよね","ts":"1635329988.181600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3dm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6565419-2ae4-4043-b8e6-11f2079cbb4d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あ、なるほど。頭悪いから disabled って状態がどっちかわからず混乱するやつだ。","ts":"1635329935.180200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u8F3L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb4afcc3-8bd4-4a86-a68b-74c8ad5ea21d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いえ、vim-lsp-settingsはefmだけはデフォルトdisabledになってて、v:false設定して有効にするという設定です。で、この方は有効にするに disabled : v:false してた\nで、それを削除=efmを止めてsolagraphが上手く動いたとのこと","ts":"1635329723.179400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mZGfN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dfdf105-45f2-4eb1-9743-f41578f1cec6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`{'disabled': v:false},}` が効いてないのはちょっと気になりますね…。なんだろう。","ts":"1635329424.178300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5c="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fec0b944-ff46-4890-923c-88ec98f5c1c5","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"とりあえずefm-langserverのblocklistに`'ruby'` を指定して動くようにしました","ts":"1635328861.177700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WcX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5177f47b-4ab2-4a50-b979-67fba88040ce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんだろう?、filetypeのは、そのファイルタイプで必要なものだけ動かす、という設定なのでうごきそうなもんだけどなあ","ts":"1635328307.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9oe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fa0907a-ffaf-46d9-b562-ffcdc12a068c","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"他の言語だとefm-langseverと共存できてるんですけど反応させる優先順位のようなものって設定できますか？","ts":"1635328303.176000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6oD0v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b9166ee-7704-4209-b7cd-c64bbb319275","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"`let g:lsp_settings_filetype_ruby = ['solargraph']` ではうまくいってなさそうです\n自分の設定の  `g:lep_settings = { efm-langserver': {'disabled': v:false},}` の部分を消すとうまく行きました","ts":"1635328211.174500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZUE+Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1376b674-f39f-4322-838f-521421223f09","type":"message","user":"UAZ